## 11. Performance & SEO

| Technique | How |
|-----------|-----|
| **Image optimization** | Next.js `next/image` with `layout="responsive"` |
| **Code splitting** | Dynamic imports (`next/dynamic`) |
| **Static generation** | `getStaticProps` for product pages |
| **Lazy loading** | `loading="lazy"` on images |
| **Meta tags** | `next/head` for title, description, Open Graph |
| **Structured data** | JSON‑LD for products |
| **Critical CSS** | Tailwind purge + `next/font` for fonts |

```tsx
// src/pages/product/[slug].tsx
import Image from "next/image";

<Image src={product.imageUrl} alt={product.title} width={600} height={400} />
```

